msgid "Mon"
msgstr "周一"

msgid "Tue"
msgstr "周二"

msgid "Wed"
msgstr "周三"

msgid "Thu"
msgstr "周四"

msgid "Fri"
msgstr "周五"

msgid "Sat"
msgstr "周六"

msgid "Sun"
msgstr "周日"

msgid "Blocking"
msgstr "禁止中"

msgid "Limiting"
msgstr "限速中"

msgid "Allowance left"
msgstr "额度未用完"

msgid "Outside time window"
msgstr "不在生效时段"

msgid "No status yet. Install and start the domain-limit service, then reopen this page."
msgstr "还没有读到运行状态。安装并启动 domain-limit 服务后再打开本页。"

msgid "dnsmasq was built without nftset support. Install dnsmasq-full, otherwise addresses resolved by clients are not added to the limit sets. The router still resolves the domains itself every 90 seconds."
msgstr "dnsmasq 没有编译 nftset。请安装 dnsmasq-full，否则客户端解析出的新地址不会自动写入限速集合。路由仍会每 90 秒自己解析一次。"

msgid "Automatic loading of nftables includes (auto_includes) is disabled in the firewall. The rules on this page will not reach the forward path."
msgstr "防火墙关闭了自动载入 nftables 脚本（auto_includes）。本页的规则不会进入转发路径。"

msgid "Flow offloading is enabled and bypasses the limit. Disable software and hardware flow offloading under Network → Firewall. If the device has Turbo ACC, fast forwarding or NSS acceleration, disable those as well."
msgstr "流量分载开着，限速会被绕过。请到「网络 → 防火墙」关闭软件流量分载和硬件流量分载。机型如果有 Turbo ACC、快捷转发或 NSS 硬件加速，也一并关掉。"

msgid "The limit is not active yet. Turn on the main switch, add at least one rule, then save and apply."
msgstr "限速还没生效。打开总开关，添加至少一条规则，然后保存并应用。"

msgid "%d / %d min"
msgstr "%d / %d 分钟"

msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d 分钟"

msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Used today"
msgstr "今日已用"

msgid "IPv4 addresses"
msgstr "已收录 IPv4"

msgid "IPv6 addresses"
msgstr "已收录 IPv6"

msgid "Upload drops"
msgstr "上行丢包"

msgid "Download drops"
msgstr "下行丢包"

msgid "If the address count is 0, the device is probably still using its own DNS cache. Reconnect it, or wait for the cache to expire, then visit the site again."
msgstr "已收录地址为 0 时，这台设备多半还在用自己的 DNS 缓存。断开重连，或等缓存过期后再访问目标网站。"

msgid "Use 24-hour HH:MM, e.g. 22:30"
msgstr "请用 24 小时制 HH:MM，例如 22:30"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "正在读取…"

msgid "Current status"
msgstr "当前状态"

msgid "Domain Rate Limit"
msgstr "域名限速"

msgid "Limit or block selected apps and domains for one device, optionally only at certain times or after a daily allowance. Rates are in Mbps (megabits per second). Entering example.com also covers its subdomains. Devices must use the router as DNS server; Private DNS on phones or encrypted DNS in browsers prevents domain matching. Prefer a MAC address so the rule survives IP changes. With only an IPv4 address, IPv6 traffic is not limited."
msgstr "对某一台设备访问指定 App 和域名进行限速或禁止，可以只在某些时段生效，或在每日额度用完后生效，其它网站不受影响。速率单位是 Mbps（兆比特/秒）。填写 example.com 时，它的子域名会一起计算。设备请使用路由器的 DNS；手机私人 DNS、浏览器加密 DNS 会对不上域名。优先填 MAC，这样 IP 变化后仍然有效。只填 IPv4 时，IPv6 不受这条规则限制。"

msgid "Main switch"
msgstr "总开关"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "LAN device"
msgstr "LAN 设备名"

msgid "Leave empty to use the device of interface lan, usually br-lan."
msgstr "留空则使用接口 lan 的设备，一般是 br-lan。"

msgid "Device names may contain only letters, digits, dots, underscores and hyphens"
msgstr "设备名只能包含字母、数字、点、下划线和减号"

msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

msgid "Time control"
msgstr "时间控制"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "e.g. Living room TV"
msgstr "例如：客厅电视"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "Apps / domains"
msgstr "App / 域名"

msgid "Domains: %d"
msgstr "域名 %d 个"

msgid "Select the MAC of an online device, or enter a MAC / IPv4 address."
msgstr "选择在线设备的 MAC，或手填 MAC / IPv4。"

msgid "Enter a MAC (aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff) or an IPv4 address"
msgstr "填写 MAC（aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff）或 IPv4 地址"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "App"

msgid "The domains of the selected apps are added automatically. App domain lists are best effort and are updated with the package."
msgstr "所选 App 的域名会自动加入。App 域名列表尽量收全但不保证完整，会随软件包更新。"

msgid "Extra domains"
msgstr "额外域名"

msgid "Type the domain and click Save; there is no need to click the plus button first. Do not include the protocol or path. Enter internationalized domains in punycode (starting with xn--)."
msgstr "直接填写后点保存即可，不必先点加号。不要写协议和路径。中文域名请填 punycode（xn-- 开头）。"

msgid "Invalid domain, e.g. example.com"
msgstr "域名格式不正确，例如 example.com"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Limit speed"
msgstr "限速"

msgid "Block"
msgstr "禁止访问"

msgid "Download (Mbps)"
msgstr "下行 Mbps"

msgid "Upload (Mbps)"
msgstr "上行 Mbps"

msgid "%s / %s Mbps"
msgstr "%s / %s Mbps"

msgid "When"
msgstr "生效时间"

msgid "Always"
msgstr "始终"

msgid "Only within a time window"
msgstr "仅在指定时段"

msgid "Days"
msgstr "星期"

msgid "From"
msgstr "开始"

msgid "To"
msgstr "结束"

msgid "A window that ends before it starts runs past midnight, e.g. 22:00 to 07:00. The same start and end means the whole day."
msgstr "结束早于开始表示跨过午夜，例如 22:00 到 07:00。开始和结束相同表示全天。"

msgid "Daily allowance (minutes)"
msgstr "每日额度（分钟）"

msgid "Minutes per day the apps can be used freely before the action applies; the count resets at midnight. Only minutes with real traffic count. 0 or empty applies the action right away."
msgstr "每天可以不受限制使用的分钟数，用完后才执行上面的动作，午夜清零。只统计真正有流量的分钟。填 0 或留空表示立即执行。"

msgid "Every day"
msgstr "每天"

msgid "after %d min/day"
msgstr "每天用满 %d 分钟后"
